<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Rohingya Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Galatiyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Galatiyo okkolor hãse Paulusor seṛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatiyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt1">Galatiyo okkolor hãse Paulusor šeṛi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="s">Salam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Ãi Paulos Isa Mosir ekzon asab, manuš okkol otóba hono manušor duwara no, kintu Isa Mosi edde Allah Baf, ze hibare mora okkolor butottu tuille. <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>Ãi edde ãr fũwati asede hár torikotor báiboinain okkolor torfottu</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GAL 1:2"/>
  <para style="p" vid="GAL 1:2">Galatiyat šomaz okkolor hãse:<verse eid="GAL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Allah baf edde ãrar Malik Isa Mosir torfottu tũwarar uwore rahamot edde šanti ok, <verse eid="GAL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>ze ãrar gunalla boli nizor zibon diye, zene hibaye ãrar Baf Allar issa mozin ãrare ehonor horaf zobanattu uddar gori fare, <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>hamišalla Allar šanor tarif ok! Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Kušir hóbor oinno ar ekkan nai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Ãi ammuwak oir ze Mosir doyat ze Allaye tũwarare ḍaikke, eto toratori hibare felaizaigoiyore ar oinno ekkan kušir hóborot zor, <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>asole hiyan kušir hóbor no. En hodun manuš ase zine tũwarare uldafaldat felar edde Mosir babute kušir hóborore bodoli felaito sar. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Kintu ze kušir hóbor ãra tũwarar hãse tobolig goijji, hinottuwaro aleda hono šikka ãra ba behostor firistaye tũwarare de, toile hitar uwore gozob forok. <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Ãra in age o hoilam, ar ãi tũwarare abar o hoir: Ze kušir hóbor tũwara goisso, hin bade ar oinno šikka zodi honokiye tũwarare de, hitar uwore gozob forok.<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Ãi ki ehon manušor nam faibolla ne Allar nam faibolla saidde? Ãi ki manušore razi goribolla kušiš gorir? No! Zodi ãi ehono manušore razi gorat takitam, henoile ãi ekzon Mosir gulam no oitam.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulosore asab oibolla ḍaikke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Báiboinain okkol, ãi tũwarare zanai dir, ze kušir hóbor ãi tobolig goijji, hiyan mainšottu no. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Iyan ãi hono mainšottu faiyi de no, ar hono mainšottu šikkide o no, iyan ãlla Isa Mosiye forhaš goijje.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Ihudi dórmot age ãr ze solafira aššil, hiyanor babute tũwara fuinno, ãi Allar zomatore hoto beši zulum goritam edde hiyanore dongšo gorifelaibolla kušiš goritam. <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>Ar ãi Ihudi dórmot ãr zatit, ãr boyošša beši manušor butore ãi barik aššilam, hiyan bade o ãr bafdada okkolor rosonolla ãttu beši ṭan aššil. <verse eid="GAL 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Kintu Allah, ze ãre ãr mar feṛottu loti basi loiye edde hibar doyar butore ḍaikke, hiba beši razi oiye, <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>ãr butore hibar Futore forhaš goribolla, zene ãi oihudi okkolor hãse hibar babute tobolig gori fari. Hetunot ãi hiyan hono manuš zati loi biyasana no gori. <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>Ar Zeruzalemot hitara zara ãr age asab oil hitarar heṛe o no zai, kintu Arob dešot gilamboi. Toi abar Damaskusot uwafes firi aišši.<verse eid="GAL 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Toi tin bosor bade ãi Zeruzalemot Fitor loi dola oito gilam, ar hibar fũwati heṛe fundro din takkilam. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Ãi šude Malikor bái Yakubore sara ar hono asab okkolore no deki. <verse eid="GAL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Allare sarme raki hoir, ãi tũwarar hãse zin lekir, hin misa no!<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Tarfore ãi Siriya edde Kilikiya eleha okkolot gilam. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Ar hẽtte o Ehudiya elehar Mosir zomat okkole ãr siyara no deke. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Hitara šude ei hota howa oiyede fuinnil, "Ze ãrare age zulum goitto, ehon hite nize he biššašganor tobolig gorer, ziyan hite ek hale dongšo gorifelaibolla kušiš goijje." <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Tarfore ãlla hitara Allar tarif goijje.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s">Oinno asab okkole Paulosore goisse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Soiddo bosor bade ãi Barnabasor fũwati abar uwore Zeruzalem giyi, ar Titusore o fũwati loigiyi. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Ãi ohi fonor zoriya heṛe giyilam edde Oihudi okkolor hãse ze kušir hóbor tobolig gori ãi hin okkol goinno mainno zimmadar okkolor hase gufone hoi funaiyi, kiyollahoile ãi hono hannasun behazor dũra dũrir ne hiyanor ḍore. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>En ki, bái Titus, ze Girik zati ãr fũwati aššil, hitare udda azomi gora foribo hoi zur no gore. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Asole ei goṭona uiṭṭilde haron oilde hoekzon misa biššašiye Mosi Isar butore ze azadi ãrattu ase hiyanore hitara gufone spaigiri goribolla góillegai, toi zene hitara ãrare gulam banaifelai fare. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Ãra hitarare ekka gorilla udda šuzug no di, kiyollahoile ãra saiyi ze kušir hóboror soyi tũwarar fũwati mojbut take.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Ar zarare beši goinno mainno zimmadar dora oito, hitara zettor ḍõr oibo ok, hiyanot ãttu kissu aiye no za, kiyollahoile Allaye manušore forok no gore. Ar he goinno mainno zimmadar okkole ãi hoi funaiyide hinot noya hono kissu zug no gore. <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Bolke aro uzan dekilo ze Fitorore zendilla azomi goraiya okkolor hãse kušir hóbor tobolig goribolla, hendila ãre o Oihudi okkolor hãse kušir hóbor tobolig goribolla bár diya oil. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Kiyollahoile, ze Allaye azomi goraiya okkololla Fitorore asab goijje, hibaye ãre o oinno zati okkololla asab goijje. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Ar Yakub, Fitor edde Yuhanna, hitara zarare asol faiya hisabe gona o, ãi hon doya faiyi hiyan buzi fariyore hitara ãi edde Barnabas loi hitarar šiyardar hisabe den hat milaiye ze ãra oinno zati okkolor hãse, ar hitara azomi goraiya okkolor hãse za. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Hitara šude hoil ze ãra zene gorib okkolore monot raki, ziyan ãi goribolla o ãttu issa aššil.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ihudi edde Oihudi biššašor duwara forhesgar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Ar zẽtte Fitor Anṭiyokot aišše, ãi sarma sarmi hibar berudde tiyaiyi, kiyollahoile hibaye oinnai goijjil. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Kiyollahoile Yakubor hentu kissu manuš aibar age, hibaye oinno zati okkolor fũwati hána haito, hitara zẽtte aišše, hibaye he azomi goraiya okkolore ḍoraiyore hiba fissa hõiṭṭe edde ga alok gora šuru goijje. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Ar hibar fũwati oinno Ihudi okkole endilla bonḍami gora šuru goijje, enki Barnabasore o hitarar bonḍamiye ṭainne.<verse eid="GAL 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Kintu ãi zehon dekilam ze hitara kušir hóboror soiyi mozin no soler, ãi beggunor sarme Fitorore hoidde, "Tũi ekzon Ihudi oiyore zodi ekzon Ihudir ḍoilla no soliyore oinno zatir ḍoilla hassa goro, toile tũi kengori oinno zati okkolore Ihudi okkolor ḍoilla oi solibolla zur gorifariba?<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>"Ãra foidaši Ihudi, ar oinno gunagar zati no. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>Tarfore o, ãra iyan zani ze ekzon manušore Torar ainor ham goronor zoriya forhesgar gona no o, šude Isa Mosir uwore biššašor zoriya o. Hetolla ãra o Mosir uwore biššaš ainni, toi zene ãrare forhesgar gone, Mosi Isar uwore biššašor zoriya, ar ainor ham goronor zoriya no, kiyollahoile ainor ham goriyore honokiye forhesgar oi no fare.<verse eid="GAL 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>"Ar zodi Mosir uwore biššašor zoriya forhesgar oito zaiyore ãra gunagar oi, Mosi ki toile gunar šeba goroya? Ebbere o no! <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Kiyollahoile ãi zinottu niyoli giyigoi, hin zodi ãi abar bandi tuli, toile ãre ãi ekzon ain bangoya oiyum.<verse eid="GAL 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>"Kiyollahoile ãi ainor duwara ainot morigiyigoi, toi zene ãi Allalla zibon haṛai fari. <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>Ãre Mosir fũwati kurušot diya oiye, ãi ar zinda nai, kintu ãr butore Mosi zinda ase. Ar ze zibon ãi manuš hisabe haṛair hiyan ãi Allar Futor uwore biššaš raki haṛair, zibaye ãre muhabbot goijje edde hiba nize kurbani hisabe ãlla kurban oiye. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Ãi Allar doyare batil no gori, kiyollahoile zodi forhesgari Torar ainor duwara o, toile Mosi behazor moijje!"<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ainor ham ne naki biššaš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>O bekub Galatiyo okkol! Tũwarare zadu hone goijje? Isa Mosire kurušot diyore marifela oilde hiyan ki tũwarar sukor sarme kulasa gori howa no o ne? <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Ãi tũwarattu iyan zainto sair: Tũwara Pak Ruhure ki ainor ham goronor duwara faiyode ne naki ze kušir hóbor fuinno edde biššaš goijjo hinor duwara? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Tũwara eto bekub ka? Tũwara Ruh loi noya zibon šuru goriyore, ehon gar issa mozin šeš goitto sodde neki? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Edun duk hošto zin tũwara búg goijjo in ki hannasun ne? Asole hiyan zodi hannasun oito! <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Tũwarare zibaye Ruh de edde tũwarar butore keramoti ham okkol gore, hibaye hin ainor ham goronor zoriya ne, naki kušir hóbor fuinno edde biššaš goijjode hetolla gore de? <verse eid="GAL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Bafi so, Ibrahime "Allare biššaš goijjil, ar hetolla Allaye hibare forhesgar hisabe goissil."<verse eid="GAL 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>Hetolla tũwara iyan zani rako, hitara zarattu biššaš ase hitara oilde Ibrahimor fuwain. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>Pak kitabot agam hóbor hisabe leikka ase, Allaye Oihudi okkolore biššašor duwara forhesgar hisabe gosibo. Bout agottu loti ei kušir hóboror babute Ibrahimore zanai diya oil, <char style="qt">"Hár zati okkolore tor duwara rahamot gora oibo."</char> <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Hetolla hitara zara biššaši, he biššaši Ibrahimor fũwati hitara o rahamoti.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Kiyollahoile hitara zara ainor uwore boroša gore hitara oilde gozobor tole, kiyollahoile iyan endilla leka ase: "Hár kissu zin ain kitabot leka ase hin beggun ze falon no gore, hitara fotti ekzon gozobor tole." <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>Iyan foriškar ze, ze hono kiye ainor uwore boroša gore, hite Allar sarme forhesgar no oibo, kiyollahoile, "Forhesgar okkol biššaš loi zibon haṛaibo." <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>Biššaš loi Torar ain loi hono baza nai, bolke endilla leka ase, "Ainor hár kissu mozin ze sole, hite hin loi basibo." <verse eid="GAL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>Mosiye ãrar gozob hibar uwore loiyore hiba nize gozoippa oiyore ãrare ainor gozobottu azad goijje, kiyollahoile iyan endilla leka ase, "Ze hono kiyore gasor uwore loṭka o, hite gozoippa." <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Hibaye ãrare azad goijje, toi zene ze rahamot Ibrahimore diya oil hiyan Mosi Isar duwara Oihudi okkolor hãse fõsi fare, toi zene ãra biššašor duwara wada gora Pak Ruhure gosi fari.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Torar ain edde wada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Báiboinain okkol, ãi tũwarare amfam ekkan mesal diyore buzai. Duizon manuše zẽtte razi oiyore ekkan wadar sukti gore, hiyan honokiye bangi no fare, ar hiyanot kissu zug o gori no fare. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>He bafe Allaye Ibrahimore edde hibar bongšore wada diye. Pak kitabot "bongšo okkolore," mani manuš okkol boli no ho, bolke "tor bongšore," mani ekzon, hiba oilde Mosi. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Ãi hoidde hiyan oilde endilla: Ze Torar ain 430 bosor bade aišše hiyane Allar foilar wadar suktire batil gori no fare. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Allar hadiya zodi ainor duwara diya oito, toile hiyan ar hono wadar duwara no; kintu Allaye hibar doyar butore Ibrahimore he hadiya wadar duwara dan goijje.<verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Toile Torar ain kiyolla dilo? Iyan zug gora oiyede naformanire sinibolla edde he wada gora bongšo nu aiye foijjonto hiyan zari take. Ei ain firista okkolor duwara mazottu ekzonor duwara diya oil. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Zeṛe ekzon heṛe hono mazottu ekzon no lage, ar Allah oilde ek.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Torar ain ki toile Allar wadar ulda? Ebbere o no! Kiyollahoile Allaye zodi endilla ekkan ain dito ziyane akerotor zibon de, toile hameka ainor duwara forhesgar oi faitto. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Kintu pak kitabe ho, manuš beggun gunar tole bondi ase, zene zara Isa Mosir uwore biššas gore hitara hitarar biššašor duwara wada gora hadiya fa.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Allar fuwain</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Biššaš aibar age Torar aine ãrare fahara dil, he biššaš forhaš no o foijjonto ãrare bondi gori raikkil. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Hetolla Mosi nu aiye foijjonto ain ãrar ustad aiššil, zene ãrare biššašor duwara forhesgar hisabe gosa o. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Kintu ehon zehon Mosir uwore biššaš goribar babute kušir hóbor aigiyegoi, ar ãra ainor odínot nai.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Tũwara beggune Mosi Isar uwore biššaš goronor duwara Allar fuwain oiyo. <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Kiyollahoile tũwara zarare Mosir butore torikotor gusol diya oiye, tũwara Mosire hor fĩdofan fĩdifelayo. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Toi hetolla Ihudi edde Oihudir maze, gulam edde azad mainšor maze, mayafuwain ar morod fuwaindor maze, hono forok nai, kiyollahoile tũwara Mosi Isat beggun ek. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>Tũwara zodi Mosir o, toile wada mozin tũwara Ibrahimor bongšo edde mirasdar.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Ãi hoidde hiyan oilde endilla: Mirazdar zetodin nabalok take hite hár kissur giros oile o, hite loi ekzon gulam loi hono forok no take. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Bafe osiyot namat ṭaim ṭik gori giyede he foijjonto hitattu he murubbi edde biššaši sõloya okkolor tole taka fore. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Hendila ãra o nabalok takite, duniyabi ruhur šikkar tole gulam aššilam. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Kintu ṭaim zehon furafuri bafe aišše, Allaye hibar Futore defeṛaiye, ze ek mayafuwattu zormo oiye, edde Torar ain mozin soille, <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>ainor tole aššilde hitarare azad goribolla, toi zene ãra Allar fuwain oi fari. <verse eid="GAL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Tũwara fuwainde hetolla, Allaye hibar Futor Ruhure ãrar dilot defeṛaiye, ze Ruhuye "Abba, Baf" hoi ḍake. <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Hetolla tũwara ar gulam nai, bolke Allar fuwain. Tũwara hibar fuwain oiyode hisabe, Allaye tũwarare o Mosir fũwati mirazdar goijje.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Galatiyo biššaši okkololla Paulosor sinta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Age zẽtte tũwara Allare no sinita, hẽtte zara asole allah no tũwara hitarar gulamir tole aššila. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Ar ehon, tũwara Allare sinno bolke endilla howa za ze Allaye tũwarare goisse, henot tũwara kengori abar duniyaibi komzur edde behazor ruhur mikka firi zorgoi? Tũwarattu hono abar hitarar gulam oito mone hor ne? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Tũwara hás hás din, maš, musum, edde bosor okkol falon goror! <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Ãi tũwaralla ḍorair, ze haṛoni ãi tũwaralla goijji hin hono behazor goillam ne.<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Báiboinain okkol, ãi tũwarar hãse foriyad gorir, tũwara ãr ḍoilla o, kiyollahoile ãi o tũwarar ḍoilla oiyi. Tũwara ãr hono hoti no goro. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Iyan to tũwara zanode hota, ze ãr biyaramor zoriya foilabar ãi tũwarar hãse kušir hóbor tobolig gori faijjilam. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Ãr biyaramor zoriya zodi o ãi tũwaralla ugguwa fũza oilam, to ãre tũwara ošormani otóba batil no goro, bolke tũwara ãre Allar ek firistare ba Mosi Isare gosefan gori gossila. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Ehon tũwarar dilottu he kuši hoṛe giyegoi? Ãi tũwarar babute endilla goba di faijjum ze, faitta boli tũwarar nizor suk udda kuli ãre difelaita. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Tũwarare soyi hoiyore hono ãi ehon tũwarar dušmon oigilamboi ne?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Misa šikka doya okkol zarar babute ãi tũwarare hoilam hitara tũwarar dil zitito sadde, hiyan balailla no. Hitara sadde oilde šude tũwarare ãttu alok goitto, toi zene tũwara hitarar fisa loibolla issa goro. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Issa takon bala, hiyan zodi balalla o, ar hiyan hamišalla owa foribo, šude ãi tũwarar fũwati takide hẽtte oile no oibo. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>O ãr adoijja fuwain okkol, zetodin tũwarar butore Mosi no bone, hetodin foijjonto ugguwa fuwa oibar šomot zendilla maye duk fa, hendilla ãi tũwarare loi duk fair. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>Ãttu hondilla mone hor hoile zodi ãi ehon tũwarar hãse ai faittam hotagunore ãi tũwara loi oinno ḍoilla gori hoitam. Ãi tũwaralla beši sintat forigiyigoi.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hazera edde Sarar mesal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Tũwara zarattu Torar ainor tole taito mone hor, ãi tũwarattu fusar gori, aine ki ho tũwara no funo? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Kiyollahoile endilla leka ase ze, Ibrahimottu dui fut aššil, ekzon bandi maya fuwattu oiye, ar ekzon nizor bou Sarattu oiye. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Ziba bandi maya fuwattu zormo oiye hiba duniyair niyom mozin oiye, ar ziba nizor bouwottu zormo oiye hiba Allar wada mozin oiye.<verse eid="GAL 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Ei hotagan mesal hisabe lowa or: Ei mayafuwain dunizon duiyan suktir ḍoilla. Sukti ziyan Sinai faharottu aišše, hiyane manušore ainor tole gulam banai raikke. Hazera hiyanor ḍoilla. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Hiba oilde Arob dešor Sinai fahar, ar hiba ei duniyair Zeruzalem šohor loi ek ḍoilla, kiyollahoile hiyanor manuš okkol ainor gulamir tole ase. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Kintu Sarah oilde behostor Zeruzalem loi ek ḍoilla ziyan azad, hiba ãrar ma. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>Kiyollahoile pak kitabot leka ase ze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">"O bázá maya fuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">tottu zattu honodin fuwain no o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">edde fuwa biyar duk búg gora no fore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">tui anondo gor, kušiye dõr gori uzor de,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">kiyollahoile tiyag goijja mayafuwar fuwain,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">zamaiwala mayafuwar fuwaindottuwaro beši oibo."<verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Báiboinain okkol, Isakor ḍoilla tũwara o wadar fuwain. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>He ṭaimot Ibrahimor fut Ismail, ziba duniyair niyom mozin zormo oiye, hite Allar Ruhur bole oiyede he Isakore zulum goitto. Ehon o hendila or. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Kintu pak kitabe ki ho? Pak kitabe hor ze, "Ei bandi mayafuware edde ibar futore niyolai do, kiyollahoile ei bandir fute azad mayafuwar futor fũwati šombottir mirazdar no oibo." <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Hetolla báiboinain okkol, ãra bandi mayafuwar fuwain no, bolke azad mayafuwar fuwain okkol.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s">Mosir azadit mojbut tako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Mosiye ãrare ainottu azad goijje zene ãra azad taki fari. Hetolla tũwara mojbut tako, edde tũwara abar gulamir zuwãlor tole oi no zaiyogoi.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Funo! ãi Paulos tũwarare hoir, tũwara zodi azomi goro, toile Mosiye tũwarare hono faida no dibo. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Ãi abar ei goba di hoir, ze honokiye azomi gora, hitattu baiddoi Torar ainor hár hokum mana fore. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Tũwara zara Torar ain falon gori forhesgar oito sor, tũwara Mosittu alok. Tũwara Allar doyattu forigiyogoi. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Kiyollahoile ãra zani ze Allaye ãrare forhesgar hisabe gosibo. Ei aša loi ãra Pak Ruhur duwara biššaš loi entezar gori asi. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Kiyollahoile Mosi Isar butore azomi goijja ba agoijja hono forok nai. Asol oilde biššaš, ziyan muhabbotor duwara ham gore.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Tũwara to bala fõtot solat aššila! Ei soyi manattu tũwarare hone tiya goraifelaiye? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Zibaye tũwarare ḍaikke iyan hibar torfottu aiššede no. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>Monot raikko ze, ekkanagori iše gũṛa hãiyore fulaitule. <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Ãttu Malikor uwore tũwarar babute furafuri biššaš ase ze, tũwara oinno ar hono ḍoilla šikka no gosiba. Ar ze tũwarare olzuwolot felar, hite ze oibo ok, hite šaza faibo. <verse eid="GAL 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Báiboinain okkol, zodi ãi ehono azomi gora dorhar hoi šikka didde oile, toile ãre ehono kiyolla zulum gora or? Hen oito bolide Mosir kurušor babute tobolig goitte hono banda no oito edde hiyanot manuš okkol gušša no oito. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Hitara zara tũwarare azomi gora loi olzuwolot felar, ãi issa gori, hitarar nizor boda udda haṛi felok.<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tũwara Pak Ruhur duwara zibon haṛo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>O báiboinain okkol, tũwarare azadit ḍaka oiyede, ar he azadire tũwara nizor monor issa mozin bebar no goijjo, bolke muhabbot loi ekzone ar ekzonor šeba goro. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Kiyollahoile Torar ain beggun ei ekkan hokum falon gora loi furon o, hiyan oilde, "Tũi tũwar ḍen gór bam gójjare nizor ḍoilla muhabbot goro." <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Ar tũwara zodi ekzone ar ekzon loi hõrahõri edde rišariši goro, hušiyar, hendila gorile tũwara ekzone ar ekzonore dongšo gori felaiba.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Hetolla ãi tũwarare ei hota hoir, tũwara Pak Ruhur duwara zibon haṛo, henoile tũwara nizor monor issa furon no goriba. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Kiyollahoile ziyan manuš zatir issa hiyan Pak Ruhur issar ulda, ar ziyan Pak Ruhur issa hiyan manuš zatir issar ulda. In ekkan loi ekkan no bone, iyanor mani tũwarattu ziyan goitto mone ho he issa mozin gori no fariba. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Ar tũwara zodi Pak Ruhur duwara zibon haṛo, toile tũwara Torar ainor tole no.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Manuš zatir bod issa okkol ki ki iyan beši foriškar, hin okkol oilde: Zena, nafaki ham, kukiyal, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>muttifũza, zadu bidda, dušmonai, hoilhoijja, riš, gušša, šude nizor balailla bafa, faṭa faṭi, edde gurup gurup owa. <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>Ar ekzonor zinišor uwore lalsi, niša hái fol owa, bodmaši rong ḍongor aḍḍa, ar endilla aro bout kissu. Zinor babute ãi tũwarare age loti hušiyar gori diyi, hendila abar o hušiyar gori dir ze, zara endilla horaf ham okkol gore hitara Allar raijjot goli no faribo.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pak Ruhur fól okkol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Ar Pak Ruhur fól oilde in: Muhabbot, kuši, šanti, bordaš, ador doya, balai, biššaš, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>norom gori sola, edde nizore sõli raka. In okkolor ulda hono ain nai. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Ar hitara zara Mosi Isar manuš, hitara nizor gare edde hiyanor hár horaf hamor issa okkolore marifelaiye. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Ãra zodi Pak Ruhur duwara zinda, toile ãra Pak Ruhur dehai diya mozin soli. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Aiyo, ãra borai no gori, ekzone ar ekzonore gušša tuli no di edde riš no gori.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ekzone ar ekzonor fũza boiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Báiboinain okkol, tũwarar butottu hono ekzone zodi guna goredde dora fore, toile tũwara zara Pak Ruhur dehaidiya mozin solo tũwara hitare noromor sãte tuli ano. Kintu nize hušiyar taikko, ar no oile tũwara o dúhat fori zaibagoi. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Tũwara ekzone ar ekzonor fũza boiyo, endilla gori Mosir ainore falon goro. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Honokiye zodi nizore nize kissu no oi bade o kissu oi boli mone gore, hitare hite dúha de. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Hiyan gorattuwaro fotti ekzonottu nizor nizor ham okkolore forikka gora foribo. Toi hitara oinno manušor ham loi nizorgun loi fuwainna no goriyore, nizor ham loi nize borai gori faribo. <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>Kiyollahoile fotti ekzonottu zar zar fũza tattu bowa foribo. <verse eid="GAL 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Ze Allar kalamor babute šike hitattu ustadore hitar hár bala ziniš okkolor bag dón sa.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Tũwara dúhat no foijjo, Allah loi ṭaṭṭa moškari no sole, kiyollahoile ze zin laga, hite hin da. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Hite ze nizor issare furon goribolla zibon haṛa, hite en ekzon aillar ḍoilla ze horaf zobinot sara laga, hite hiyanottu moronor fól faibo. Kintu ze Pak Ruhure razi goitto zibon haṛa, hite Ruhuttu akerotor zibonor fól faibo. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Aiyo ãra bala ham gorattu óran oi no zagoi, kiyollahoile zodi ãra bala ham gorat taki, ṭik ainda aile ãra fošol dai faijjum. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Hetolla ãrattu zetun šuzug ase, aiyo ãra hár manušore balai gori, ar haas gori biššaši foribaror manuš okkolore.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Azomi gora ba no gora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>So ãi hottor hottor ḍõr okkor okkol loi ãr nizor hate tũwarar hãse lekir! <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Hitara zara tũwarare azomi goraibolla zur gorer, hitara oilde endilla manuš zara battu bala dehaito sar, toi zene hitara Mosir kurušolla zulum fattu basizagoi. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Kiyollahoile zara azomi gore hitara udda Torar ain mozin no sole, tarfore o hitara tũwarare azomi goraito sar, toi zene hitara tũwarare azomi gorabai faijje hoi borai gori fare. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Kintu ãi honodin ãrar Malik Isa Mosir kurušor bade hono kissu loi borai no goijjum. Kiyollahoile he kurušor duwara duniyai ãlla mori giyegoi, ar duniyailla ãi mori giyigoi. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Azomi gora ba no gora hiyan hono kissu no, noya sirišṭi owa oilde asol ziniš. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Hitara zara beggune he noya zibon mozin sole, hitarar uwore, mani Allar he manuš okkolor uwore šanti edde doya takok.<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Šešottu hoir, ehonottu loti ar honokiye ãre hošṭo no diyo, kiyollahoile Isalla boli ãr gat dag loi berair.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Báiboinain okkol, ãrar Malik Isa Mosir doya tũwarar fũwati takok. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
